 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-06-23",
   "text": "Safe Skies Act of 2021\n This bill directs the Department of Transportation (DOT) to modify a specified DOT final rule relating to flight crew member duty and rest requirements so that the requirements under that rule apply to all-cargo flight crew members to the same extent they apply to air passenger flight crew members."
  }
